      "id": "ember_vaso_stone_told",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“Esk talks about stone. Squared stone, a quarter-mile in.” He wipes the counter. “I have known him forty years and he has never once made a thing up, which is why I have stopped asking him about it.”"
        }
      ],
